{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pulls/120","id":5232810537,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVLcacc8AAAABN-ZaKQ","html_url":"https://github.com/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pull/120","diff_url":"https://github.com/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pull/120.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pull/120.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/issues/120","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pulls/120/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pulls/120/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/issues/120/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PrincipalLewis/egg-farm/statuses/0bbcea5277a7be7f8e8d4303b7aac49e0dc04a7e","number":120,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Saves: breeds re-cite to rev 3.8.9 ea922eb8 (HoE/breeds-recite-389)","user":{"login":"PrincipalLewis","id":11165572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTY1NTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11165572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis","html_url":"https://github.com/PrincipalLewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nHoE/breeds-recite-389 — re-cite Saves breeds code/tests from spec **v0.2 rev 3.8.6 `13d5255e`** to **v0.2 rev 3.8.9 `ea922eb8`**, audit the 3.8.9 deltas, add missing tests where the code already complies, and list gaps where it does not (out of write scope for this recite).\n\n**Spec verified:** `product/m5.1-breeds-spec.md` / frozen `product/m5.1-breeds-spec.ea922eb8.md` — sha1 `ea922eb8574740f15c1998cf534689d1259c12a7`, status line **v0.2 rev. 3.8.9**. Base: `origin/rc/v5` `f20b91839fdf09ba0ed45a890281ccbf7bf2909d`. Head: `0bbcea5277a7be7f8e8d4303b7aac49e0dc04a7e`.\n\n**Write scope:** breeds header comments that cited 3.8.6 + `tests/v5-breeds-state.test.ts` only. No behaviour change outside that scope.\n\n### Files\n- `src/config/breeds.ts` — header → 3.8.9 ea922eb8; sanitise-event cite note\n- `src/sim/breeds.ts` — header → 3.8.9 ea922eb8\n- `tests/v5-breeds-state.test.ts` — header + new/renamed AC-id tests\n\n### Local gates (worktree `/workspace/wt-saves-breeds-recite-389`)\n- `tsc --noEmit` → 0\n- `sync-economy --check` → 0\n- full vitest (flock + nice, maxWorkers=2): **2277 passed | 1 skipped** (155 files)\n\n### Trace table (AC id → test)\n\n| AC / clause | test file::name |\n|---|---|\n| BR-AC26 (stars/dup/silkie + sanitise) | `tests/v5-breeds-state.test.ts`::`[BR-AC26] stars 5, duplicate slot, unknown \"silkie\"…` |\n| BR-AC26 E10 F14 save-roundtrip | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E10] F14 unknown slot id: null at runtime, save-roundtrip keeps raw \"silkie\", no save_migrated` |\n| BR-AC26 E10 slot overwrite | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E10 / PMC Q5] a real slot change overwrites the raw id…` |\n| BR-AC26 E10 owned-only | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E10] owned-only unknown id (clean slots): kept ignored, no save_migrated` |\n| Q6 non-finite / null / string | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E12 / PMC Q6] non-finite remainingMs (%s) becomes 60,000…` |\n| Q6 undefined / object | `…`::`[BR-AC26 Q6] remainingMs %s -> 60,000 (non-number)…` |\n| Q6 finite fractional round | `…`::`[BR-AC26 Q6] finite fractional remainingMs is rounded then clamped` |\n| Q7 freeHatchUsed/pity/hatches/rng | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E12 / PMC Q7] %s, one save_migrated` |\n| E12 OQ-4 non-string slot | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E12 OQ-4] non-string slot entry becomes null…` |\n| E12 locked known slot / flock flags | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E12] slot past the unlocked count is nulled…` |\n| E12 unknown incubator refund | `…`::`[BR-AC26 E12] unknown incubator breed is dropped…` |\n| E11 flag-off untouched | `…`::`[BR-AC1 / E11] flag off: the same corrupt save is left untouched…` |\n\n### Gap list (Major / Minor — not fixed here)\n\n1. **Major — §8 / BR-AC26 `save_migrated` shape**  \n   Spec requires always-present `reason` (`invalid_root`\\|`invalid_values`), `refund_cents`, `farm_level`, `backup_stores:[]`.  \n   Code: `src/config/breeds.ts:35` `BREEDS_SANITISE_EVENT` + `src/sim/events.ts:4` + push at `src/sim/breeds.ts:85` only emit `{type,migration,from,to}`. Telemetry schema already accepts the fields.  \n   Suggested fix: S (~20 LOC across 3 files) — builder in `sanitizeBreedsOnLoad`.\n\n2. **Major — E12 `invalid_root`**  \n   Spec: null/non-object/array/primitive root → re-create defaults + `reason:\"invalid_root\"`.  \n   Code: `src/sim/breeds.ts:62` returns `s` unchanged, no event.  \n   Suggested fix: S–M (~30 LOC).\n\n3. **Major — E12 over E10 for locked slots (D-COL-16 OQ-6)**  \n   Spec: any id at/past unlocked count → null and **not** kept raw.  \n   Code: `src/sim/breeds.ts:82` records raw unknown ids for locked indices; `breedsSaveView` writes them back.  \n   Suggested fix: S (gate raw on `i < open`) + regression test.\n\n4. **Minor — Q7 `freeHatchUsed` missing → 0**  \n   Spec: missing → 0; present-invalid → 1.  \n   Code: `src/sim/breeds.ts:76` treats `undefined` as invalid → 1.  \n   Suggested fix: S.\n\n5. **Minor — OQ-8 `costCents` invalid → 0 on a valid incubator**  \n   Spec: non-negative-integer coerce.  \n   Code: `src/sim/breeds.ts:70-71` only rewrites `remainingMs` for a known breed.  \n   Suggested fix: S (`int0`).\n\n6. **Minor — OQ-4 owned/slots wholesale shape**  \n   Spec: owned not plain object → `{}`; slots not length-3 array → `[null,null,null]`.  \n   Code: `owned ?? {}` still iterates arrays; slots per-index mapped.  \n   Suggested fix: S.\n\n**Note:** BR-AC31e incomes-in-$/s already matches 3.8.9 (`src/debug/breeds-qa.ts` / hatch tests); no gap.\n\n### Bundle\n`/workspace/egg-farm-studio/scratch/bundles/saves-breeds-recite-389-0bbcea5.bundle`\n\nReady for hosted CI + Architect / HoQA. Do **not** merge until HoQA GO. Not a merge-stack blocker for #107/#108/#111.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T23:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T23:17:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"690731ccc806d881d363d31216a4fdfcd3ffad99","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"PrincipalLewis:saves/breeds-recite-389","ref":"saves/breeds-recite-389","repo":{"id":1421286001,"node_id":"R_kgDOVLcacQ","name":"egg-farm","full_name":"PrincipalLewis/egg-farm","owner":{"login":"PrincipalLewis","id":11165572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTY1NTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11165572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis","html_url":"https://github.com/PrincipalLewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrincipalLewis/events{/privacy}",